From: Alan Yaniger <alan@tkos.co.il>
Date: Thu, 26 May 2022 16:27:17 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] agent: pre/post hooks around handle_var_requests

Add pre_call_handle_var_requests and post_call_handle_var_requests
function pointers to snmp_agent.c, called around handle_var_requests(),
so the Siklu SNMP plugin can run code before and after each request
(PORTF-871).

[Dima Weber: dropped the cosmetic copyright-encoding hunk]
Upstream: N/A, Siklu-specific change
Signed-off-by: Dima Weber <diepress@gmail.com>
---
--- a/agent/snmp_agent.c
+++ b/agent/snmp_agent.c
@@ -2995,6 +2995,10 @@
     return asp->status;
 }
 
+
+void (* pre_call_handle_var_requests)( netsnmp_agent_session *asp) = NULL;
+void (* post_call_handle_var_requests)( netsnmp_agent_session *asp) = NULL;
+
 int
 handle_var_requests(netsnmp_agent_session *asp)
 {
@@ -3005,6 +3009,9 @@
     asp->reqinfo->asp = asp;
     asp->reqinfo->mode = asp->mode;
 
+	if(pre_call_handle_var_requests != NULL)
+		pre_call_handle_var_requests(asp);
+
     /*
      * now, have the subtrees in the cache go search for their results 
      */
@@ -3080,6 +3087,10 @@
         }
     }
 
+
+	if(post_call_handle_var_requests != NULL)
+		post_call_handle_var_requests(asp);
+
     return final_status;
 }
 
